  "description": "Get started on your all terrain adventure! The design of the VIVI F26FUL electric bike perfectly combines unparalleled adaptability to complex riding conditions with superior comfort. Its 1000W peak high-speed motor, 48V 18Ah battery and long range of up to 50-65 miles allow you to conquer any terrain and enjoy the fun of riding. If you want to ride farther, faster and explore more terrain, this upgraded big-wheel fat tire e-bike includes everything you need to ensure peak performance while riding.\n\n1000W peak high speed brushless hub motor, 75Nm\n48V 18Ah 864Wh Removable Lithium-ion battery\n12 magnet cadence and speed sensor\nIntelligent 5 level pedal assist and digital LCD display\nLocked mechanical suspension fork, 80mm travel\nMechanical disc brakes with 160mm rotors\nShimano 7-speed gear system\n54.6V 2Amp smart charger\nTop 25Mph and Up to 65 miles of riding range (pedal assist)\n26 × 4.0\" all terrain fat tires\n\nSGS certified to UL2849 & UL2271 safety standards",
